 "section_summary": "This section contains the concluding portion of a Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers (SCAP) Civil Information and Education Section special report on educational institutions in Miyagi Prefecture, followed by the opening pages of the corresponding report for Nara Prefecture. The Miyagi report concludes its detailed statistical roster covering village and town youth schools and elementary schools, private higher, secondary, elementary, and miscellaneous institutions, and schools under ministries other than the Ministry of Education, ending with a reference map of Northern Honshu. The Nara Prefecture report begins with its title cover, special report metadata sheet, comprehensive table of contents, and introductory explanation of the survey's purpose, scope, methodology, terminology, and historical context amid post-war educational reorganization.",
