   "start_page": 74,
   "summary": "This document comprises the concluding portion (pages 46–108) of a comprehensive SCAP CI&E roster and statistical survey of educational institutions in Miyagi Prefecture for April and November 1946. It details village and town youth schools, elementary schools, and a kindergarten, followed by private colleges, secondary vocational schools, middle schools, girls' high schools, youth schools, kindergartens, and miscellaneous schools. The report also catalogues schools operated by other national ministries—including police, railway, telecommunications, and prison staff training facilities, and a juvenile reformatory—concluding with a reference map of Northern Honshu.",
